# lifecore_lab: 10 choose/feedback cycles 5 s apart. Expect 10 persists, generation 10, event_count 10.
@+5000 choose 1 1
@+5500 feedback 1 positive 1
@+10000 choose 2 0
@+10500 feedback 2 positive 1
@+15000 choose 3 1
@+15500 feedback 3 positive 1
@+20000 choose 4 0
@+20500 feedback 4 positive 1
@+25000 choose 5 1
@+25500 feedback 5 positive 1
@+30000 choose 6 0
@+30500 feedback 6 positive 1
@+35000 choose 7 1
@+35500 feedback 7 positive 1
@+40000 choose 8 0
@+40500 feedback 8 positive 1
@+45000 choose 9 1
@+45500 feedback 9 positive 1
@+50000 choose 10 0
@+50500 feedback 10 positive 1
